A damping coefficient modulates activation:
\[
\sigma_{\text{threshold}} = g\big(\|\mathcal{E}_{\text{stress}}(x,t)\|\big).
\]

\section{Cell-Cycle Invariant System}
Define:
\[
\mathcal{I}_{\text{cc}} = F\big(n(x,t), \mathcal{K}_{\text{DNA}}(x,t), \mathbf{J}_{\text{biochem}}(x,t)\big),
